From: EdgeFirst <noreply@edgefirst.ai>
Subject: [PATCH] plugins: build spdifdemux only when spdifparser.h is available

NXP's walnascar imx-parser does not provide spdifparser.h, which the wrynose
baseline of this fork includes unconditionally.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [walnascar compatibility for the EdgeFirst fork]
---
--- a/plugins/meson.build
+++ b/plugins/meson.build
@@ -90,7 +90,9 @@
     subdir('overlay_sink')
   endif
 elif build_MX8 == 'yes' or build_MX9 == 'yes'
-  subdir('spdifdemux')
+  if cc.has_header('spdifparser.h', dependencies: imx_parser_dep)
+    subdir('spdifdemux')
+  endif
   if have_asrc
     subdir('imxasrc')
   endif
